 # Changelog
 
+## [v0.1.41-test.1] - 2026-11-26
+
+> R54 strict iAP2 synchronization-table validation and MFi TLV structure checks. This does not implement MFi cryptographic verification or claim to fix E2LB vehicle startup.
+
+### English
+- Validate every initial and renegotiation SYN/SYN-ACK with the same rules: exact control flags, session 0, complete descriptor alignment, one control session, unique non-zero session IDs, supported kinds/versions, valid send window and minimum frame length.
+- Reject malformed synchronization payloads before adopting a peer session table or replying with SYN-ACK; malformed peer data no longer advances the initial handshake.
+- Validate the complete MFi 0xAA01 certificate and 0xAA03 response parameter streams; require exactly one non-empty parameter 0 and reject truncated, duplicate, missing or malformed TLVs.
+- Abort the MFi compatibility signal on malformed certificate/response structure. A structurally present signature is still explicitly unverified cryptographically.
+- Add exact-source regression tests for malformed initial SYN, unexpected SYN control/session fields, synchronization-table invariants, and MFi TLV edge cases.
+- Validation: 58 focused Kotlin/JVM tests passed with kotlinc 1.9.0; `git diff --check` passed. Full Android Gradle gate, APK packaging and real-vehicle tests remain blocked/unverified.
+
+### 简体中文
+- 初始 SYN 与后续重新协商 SYN/SYN-ACK 统一执行严格校验：控制位必须准确、会话 ID 必须为 0、会话描述符长度必须完整、恰好一个控制会话、会话 ID 不重复且非零、类型/版本合法、发送窗口和最小帧长有效。
+- 异常同步包在采纳会话表或回显 SYN-ACK 前即被拒绝，不再让畸形会话表推进初始握手。
+- 完整校验 MFi 0xAA01 证书响应和 0xAA03 挑战响应的 TLV 参数流；参数 0 必须且只能出现一次、内容非空，截断、重复、缺失或长度错误均拒绝。
+- MFi 证书/签名结构异常时中止 0xAA05 兼容信号。结构完整不等于证书链或签名已通过密码学验证。
+- 新增初始 SYN、控制位/会话 ID、会话表不变量及 MFi TLV 边界回归测试。
+- 验证：kotlinc 1.9.0 下 58 项聚焦 Kotlin/JVM 测试通过，`git diff --check` 通过；完整 Android Gradle 门禁、APK 打包和实车验证仍未完成。
+
+Full changes / 完整变更: [v0.1.40-test.1...v0.1.41-test.1](https://github.com/wangxso/mcarplay/compare/v0.1.40-test.1...v0.1.41-test.1)
+
